{"id":"51d477ca96084ca3","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-set11-subset-closure-system.md","title":"ZFC Set11 Subset Closure System","display":"df-zfc-set11-subset-closure-system — ZFC Set11 Subset Closure System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set11-subset-closure-system","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set11-subset-closure-system"],"display":"df-zfc-set11-subset-closure-system — ZFC Set11 Subset Closure System","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set11-subset-closure-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set11-subset-closure-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set11-subset-closure-system — ZFC Set11 Subset Closure System"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal C\\in V,\\quad\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(X,\\mathcal C\\in V,\\quad\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet11SubsetClosureSystem}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet11SubsetClosureSystem}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set11\\text{-}subset\\text{-}closure\\text{-}system}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcSet11SubsetClosureSystem}_S(\\mathcal C,X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land X\\in\\mathcal C\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\;\\left(\\varnothing\\neq\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal C\\to\\bigcap\\mathcal A\\in\\mathcal C\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set11\\text{-}subset\\text{-}closure\\text{-}system}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcSet11SubsetClosureSystem}_S(\\mathcal C,X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land X\\in\\mathcal C\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\;\\left(\\varnothing\\neq\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal C\\to\\bigcap\\mathcal A\\in\\mathcal C\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A Moore closure system is closed under arbitrary nonempty intersections; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathcal C\">\\(X\\in\\mathcal C\\)</span> supplies the empty intersection.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal C\\in V,\\quad\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet11SubsetClosureSystem}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set11\\text{-}subset\\text{-}closure\\text{-}system}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcSet11SubsetClosureSystem}_S(\\mathcal C,X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land X\\in\\mathcal C\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\;\\left(\\varnothing\\neq\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal C\\to\\bigcap\\mathcal A\\in\\mathcal C\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"X\\in\\mathcal C","display":false}],"bytes":967,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3418","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-set11-subset-closure-system.md|58-df-zfc-set11-subset-closure-system]]（